                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "91a7792e-5122-3a71-bdb8-1f4c7ffd7e60",
                                        "entry_id": "50c164e9-ec6a-36f3-a2e1-26b02da9a83b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having greed; consumed by selfish desires."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6fdf6299-d9f4-41d7-bf2b-e791466d3d92",
                                                "sense_id": "91a7792e-5122-3a71-bdb8-1f4c7ffd7e60",
                                                "text": "For with ſuch puiſſance and impetuous maine / Thoſe Champions broke on them, that forſt the fly, / Like ſcattered Sheepe, whenas the Shepherds ſwaine / A Lyon and a Tigre doth eſpye, / With greedy pace forth ruſhing from the foreſt nye."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8de59fd8-3141-41f2-9b70-a722b2287d0a",
                                                "sense_id": "91a7792e-5122-3a71-bdb8-1f4c7ffd7e60",
                                                "text": "“[…] Churchill, my dear fellow, we have such greedy sharks, and wolves in lamb's clothing. Oh, dear, there's so much to tell you, so many warnings to give you, but all that must be postponed for the moment.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d8c7001-3325-39fa-bc7f-908ac351ea65",
                                        "entry_id": "50c164e9-ec6a-36f3-a2e1-26b02da9a83b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Prone to overeat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bfc408bf-2ead-385f-bb59-ddb67315a9e8",
                                        "entry_id": "50c164e9-ec6a-36f3-a2e1-26b02da9a83b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tending to match as much text as possible."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a76a18a1-88b6-42dd-affd-fcfe96c27526",
                                                "sense_id": "bfc408bf-2ead-385f-bb59-ddb67315a9e8",
                                                "text": "This regular expression performs a greedy match."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2447ef2a-bf0f-3e2a-8b0f-abddbba73371",
                                        "entry_id": "50c164e9-ec6a-36f3-a2e1-26b02da9a83b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That tries to find the global optimum by finding the local optimum at each stage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of an algorithm"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c9bdfff-d784-3b36-997f-b7f38e30025f",
                                        "entry_id": "50c164e9-ec6a-36f3-a2e1-26b02da9a83b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Greedily sought or pursued."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1036ce23-bef5-4a1c-b05e-bc6f415d1afd",
                                                "sense_id": "0c9bdfff-d784-3b36-997f-b7f38e30025f",
                                                "text": "Suppoſe they be in number infinit,\nYet being voyd of Martiall diſcipline,\nAll running headlong after greedie ſpoiles: […]\nTheir careleſſe ſwords ſhal lanch their fellows throats\nAnd make vs triumph in their ouerthrow."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
