                                                "example_id": "1036ce23-bef5-4a1c-b05e-bc6f415d1afd",
                                                "sense_id": "0c9bdfff-d784-3b36-997f-b7f38e30025f",
                                                "text": "Suppoſe they be in number infinit,\nYet being voyd of Martiall diſcipline,\nAll running headlong after greedie ſpoiles: […]\nTheir careleſſe ſwords ſhal lanch their fellows throats\nAnd make vs triumph in their ouerthrow."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
